{
 "id": "verse-23-9-6-orchestral",
 "song": "/Users/vhanssen/WebstormProjects/flogvit/music/YuE/outputs/catalog/verse-23-9-6-orchestral",
 "offset_seconds": -2.760000000000197,
 "words_heard": 232,
 "words": 234,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The people who walked in darkness have seen a great light",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "On those who lived in a land of deep shadow, light has dawned",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The yoke upon their shoulders and the bar across their back",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The rod of the oppressor lies shattered in its track",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Every boot that tramped in tumult, every cloak rolled in blood",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Is fuel now for the fire, and joy comes like a flood",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They rejoice as at the harvest when the sheaves are carried in",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.97,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The long night is ending and the morning will begin",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For to us a child is born, to us a son is given",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the government will rest on his shoulders",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And his name shall be called Wonderful Counselor",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Mighty God, Everlasting Father, Prince of Peace",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He will sit on David's throne and over all his land",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With justice and with righteousness upheld by his hand",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From now until forever his kingdom will not cease",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The zeal of the LORD of hosts will accomplish this",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For to us a child is born, to us a son is given",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the government will rest on his shoulders",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And his name shall be called Wonderful Counselor",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Mighty God, Everlasting Father, Prince of Peace",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Of the increase of his government and of peace there will be no end",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The zeal of the LORD of hosts will accomplish this",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
